  "slug": "vendor-load-in-inventory-log-form",
  "title": "Vendor Load-In Inventory Log Form",
  "subtitle": "Track vendor equipment and delivery units through receipt, staging, destination handoff, return movement, and discrepancy closeout.",
  "description": "An original movement inventory ledger for cases, carts, pallets, rentals, equipment, keys, passes, and other controlled load-in units. It records custody changes, location, condition, quantity, discrepancies, return ownership, and the final reconciled balance.",
  "use_case": "Use when a load-in includes units the venue or vendor must account for across unloading, staging, setup, storage, strike, or return. Maintain one log until all entries have a final location and custody disposition.",
  "risk_tier": "A",
  "sections": [
    {
      "key": "identity_routing",
      "title": "Inventory scope and custodian",
      "guidance": "Define the movement window and who controls the ledger.",
